\subtree{
  \title{Decision}
  \p{Start with cartesian Set and Kan; matrix multicells use products and maps. General monoidal enrichment is later. Theories are exported only with universe bounds, existence hypotheses, and the appropriate comparison proofs.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Rationale}
  \p{The matrix examples test the central reuse claim with limited extra structure.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Rejected}
  \p{Requiring every monoidal base before testing the root.}
}
